<title>FRANCE: Pernod Ricard Q1 sales 3.75 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Pernod Ricard Q1 sales 3.75 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 3,754.5  vs   3,605.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Drinks group Pernod Ricard reported its consolidated first-quarter sales in the official bulletin BALO. It said a 15.8 percent sales drop in France due to stock-boosting in late 1996 ahead of a spirits tax introduced in January was more than offset by a 16.6 percent rise in sales outside France.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
